# yt-dlp Web UI — TOS 应用中心多语言文件（23 语超集）
# name/auth/version 全局一致；未翻译节点回退英文（官方自动校验只查节点存在性）

[zh-cn]
name         = "yt-dlp Web UI"
auth         = "marcopiovanello"
version      = "@@VERSION@@"
descript     = "yt-dlp Web UI 是 yt-dlp（流行的视频/音频下载器）的自托管网页界面与 RPC 服务。粘贴视频或播放列表链接、按需选择格式，NAS 即可在后台下载，并实时显示进度、下载队列与日志控制台；内置文件浏览器可列出、预览并把完成的文件提供给局域网内任意设备。本包内置 yt-dlp 运行时（官方 Python zipapp）以及 yt-dlp 处理 YouTube 所需的轻量 quickjs JavaScript 引擎；ffmpeg 使用 TOS 系统自带软件包。应用从 TOS 桌面以新标签页方式打开；后端仅监听本机回环、不对外多开任何端口，全部流量经 TOS 网页服务的标准路由转发。服务以专用非特权用户运行并施加 systemd 沙箱加固。无需单独账号：由 TOS 登录提供访问保护。"
release_note = "基于上游 yt-dlp-web-ui 4.0.0 源码构建（Go 静态编译、前端已内嵌；公开 CI 构建，源码可审计）。内置 yt-dlp 2026.08.19（官方 Python zipapp）与 quickjs-ng 0.17.0（源码编译），YouTube 下载开箱即用；ffmpeg 使用 TOS 系统软件包。下载文件、队列数据库与日志保存在 /var/lib/ytdlpwebui。配置位于 /usr/local/ytdlpwebui/config.yml 与 /usr/local/ytdlpwebui/ytdlpwebui.env，修改后重启服务。"
important    = "无需默认密码：从 TOS 桌面打开应用即由 TOS 账号完成身份验证。下载默认保存在 /var/lib/ytdlpwebui/downloads；可在内置文件浏览器中取回，或在 /usr/local/ytdlpwebui/ytdlpwebui.env 中指定其他目录后重启服务。apt remove 卸载时保留 /var/lib/ytdlpwebui 全部数据；apt purge 会彻底删除。合并视频与音频流需要系统 ffmpeg 软件包。上游采用 GPL-3.0 许可证。"

[zh-hk]
name         = "yt-dlp Web UI"
auth         = "marcopiovanello"
version      = "@@VERSION@@"
descript     = "yt-dlp Web UI 是 yt-dlp（熱門的影片／音訊下載器）的自架設網頁介面與 RPC 服務。貼上影片或播放清單連結、按需要選擇格式，NAS 便可在背景下載，並即時顯示進度、下載佇列與日誌主控台；內建檔案瀏覽器可列出、預覽並把完成的檔案提供給區域網路內任何裝置。本套件內建 yt-dlp 執行環境（官方 Python zipapp）以及 yt-dlp 處理 YouTube 所需的輕量 quickjs JavaScript 引擎；ffmpeg 使用 TOS 系統內建套件。應用從 TOS 桌面以新分頁方式開啟；後端僅監聽本機回環、不對外多開任何連接埠，全部流量經 TOS 網頁服務的標準路由轉發。服務以專用非特權使用者執行並施加 systemd 沙箱強化。無需另設帳號：由 TOS 登入提供存取保護。"
release_note = "基於上游 yt-dlp-web-ui 4.0.0 原始碼構建（Go 靜態編譯、前端已內嵌；公開 CI 構建，原始碼可稽核）。內建 yt-dlp 2026.08.19（官方 Python zipapp）與 quickjs-ng 0.17.0（原始碼編譯），YouTube 下載開箱即用；ffmpeg 使用 TOS 系統套件。下載檔案、佇列資料庫與日誌保存在 /var/lib/ytdlpwebui。設定位於 /usr/local/ytdlpwebui/config.yml 與 /usr/local/ytdlpwebui/ytdlpwebui.env，修改後重新啟動服務。"
important    = "無需預設密碼：從 TOS 桌面開啟應用即由 TOS 帳號完成身分驗證。下載預設保存在 /var/lib/ytdlpwebui/downloads；可於內建檔案瀏覽器取回，或在 /usr/local/ytdlpwebui/ytdlpwebui.env 指定其他目錄後重新啟動服務。apt remove 移除時保留 /var/lib/ytdlpwebui 全部資料；apt purge 會徹底刪除。合併影片與音訊串流需要系統 ffmpeg 套件。上游採用 GPL-3.0 授權條款。"

[en-us]
name         = "yt-dlp Web UI"
auth         = "marcopiovanello"
version      = "@@VERSION@@"
descript     = "yt-dlp Web UI is a self-hosted web interface and RPC server for yt-dlp, the popular video and audio downloader. Paste a video or playlist link, optionally choose a format, and your NAS downloads it in the background with live progress, a download queue and a log console. A built-in file browser lists, previews and serves the finished files to any device on your LAN. This package bundles the yt-dlp runtime (official Python zipapp) and the lightweight quickjs JavaScript engine that yt-dlp needs for YouTube; ffmpeg is taken from the TOS system packages. The app opens in a new browser tab from the TOS desktop. The backend listens on loopback only, so no extra port is exposed and all traffic goes through the TOS web server. It runs as a dedicated unprivileged user inside a hardened systemd sandbox. No separate account is required: access is protected by your TOS login."
release_note = "Built from the upstream yt-dlp-web-ui 4.0.0 source code (static Go binary with the web frontend embedded; public CI build with an auditable source chain). Bundles yt-dlp 2026.08.19 (official Python zipapp) and quickjs-ng 0.17.0 (compiled from source) so YouTube downloads work out of the box; ffmpeg is used from the TOS system packages. Downloads, the queue database and logs live in /var/lib/ytdlpwebui. Configuration lives in /usr/local/ytdlpwebui/config.yml and /usr/local/ytdlpwebui/ytdlpwebui.env; restart the service after editing."
important    = "No default password is needed: open the app from the TOS desktop and you are authenticated by your TOS account. Downloads are stored in /var/lib/ytdlpwebui/downloads by default; retrieve them with the built-in file browser, or set another directory in /usr/local/ytdlpwebui/ytdlpwebui.env and restart the service. 'apt remove' keeps all data in /var/lib/ytdlpwebui; 'apt purge' deletes everything. The system ffmpeg package is required to merge separate video and audio streams. Upstream license: GPL-3.0."

